WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.114
Goonɗinɓe lesdi. Goomu kurumba.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.922
Kaŋko woni lesdi cembal e yahugo. Luttuɗo lesdi hokkata ɗum ngam daliila goɗɗum.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.400
Mawɗo leydi ndii ƴiwoyi daga yimɓe arandeeji. O anndi kuuje ceniiɗe.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.348
Duniyaaru, jaɓa ɗum, hokke'en nyaamdu.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.136
To o hokki ko'e muuɗum, ɓikkoy maako ɓeyi.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:09.376
Nder nyalnde go'oto, mawɓe koyɗe ngari, ɓe ngaɗani hoore maɓɓe sembe.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.554
Mawɗo maɓɓe ɗon jooɗi nder gariiri. Mawɓe ɗon njooɗoto.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:44.314
O ɗon haako gese maako. Ammaa lesdi ɗon nyaamaako.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:56.400
Walaa ko ɓeyda. E ɓe ɗon njooɗii dow ko'e muuɗum'en e weelo.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:00.606
Yimɓe am ɗon nyaamee. Ngam ɗume walaa ko maɓɓata?

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:21.066
Ardiiɗo mawɓe'en ɓaawo maajum o laɓɓini gite maako. O yahi to mawɗo.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.832
Baabiraawo mawɗo, lesdi mon ɗon njaɓa yam.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.712
O anndaa on haa jooni.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.840
Wondini yam bee maako.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:51.036
Ɗuum waɗi alkawal.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:57.212
A umri yimɓe, nden kam mi wolwata bee lesdi.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.256
Kanko tan woni laamiiɗo duniyaaru.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.296
Ɓe fuu ɓe ɗon hokkata dokkal, nden kam ndiyam wara.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:35.648
Leydi anndi on.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:43.760
Sey mawɗo laamiiɗo jooɗoto dow laamu, daga jungo ardiiɗo duuniyaaru.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.744
Mi waawataa semde?

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.376
Joweego, ɓiɗɗo am.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:15.104
Haa nyalnde nde'e, laamiiɗo ɗon toro mawɗo lesdi.
